---
// BentoServices.astro
---

<section id="solusi" class="section container">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-tag">Layanan Ekosistem UMKM</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Pilar Transformasi Digital Tanpa Biaya Tersembunyi</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="bento-grid">
    <div class="bento-card bento-col-8" data-cursor="JELAJAH">
      <div class="bento-card-header">
        <span class="bento-badge">Unggulan Retail &amp; F&amp;B</span>
        <div class="bento-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Toko Online &amp; Katalog Order WhatsApp Mandiri</h4>
        <p>Pangkas komisi 10%–20% dari pihak ketiga. Pelanggan memesan langsung dari katalog website berkecepatan tinggi, dan pesanan otomatis masuk ke aplikasi WhatsApp kasir Anda dalam format nota siap kirim.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-card bento-col-4" data-cursor="JELAJAH">
      <div class="bento-card-header">
        <span class="bento-badge">Operasional</span>
        <div class="bento-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>POS Kasir &amp; Laporan Omzet</h4>
        <p>Cetak struk bluetooth thermal, kontrol stok gudang, dan pantau omzet cabang harian langsung dari genggaman smartphone Anda.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-card bento-col-4" data-cursor="JELAJAH">
      <div class="bento-card-header">
        <span class="bento-badge">Kredibilitas</span>
        <div class="bento-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Company Profile Resmi &amp; SEO Lokal</h4>
        <p>Mudahkan calon pembeli dan mitra korporat menemukan bisnis Anda saat mereka mencari jasa/produk di Google Maps dan Search di kota Anda.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-card bento-col-8" data-cursor="JELAJAH">
      <div class="bento-card-header">
        <span class="bento-badge">Kustom</span>
        <div class="bento-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Sistem Operasional Khusus Sesuai SOP Bisnis</h4>
        <p>Punya alur kerja unik di tempat produksi, reservasi salon, atau servis bengkel? Tim engineer Aksara merancang aplikasi web kustom yang pas dengan kebutuhan operasional spesifik Anda.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
